# Line endings (0.9 audit): the repository stores text as LF; the working tree here is LF too. Before this file the index held a mix of CRLF and LF, which made
# diffs show thousands of changed lines that were only line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
# Locked archives are byte-exact: their checksums (CHECKSUMS.sha256) are the lock, so git must never rewrite a byte there.
docs/locked/** -text
